# --- source text: NOT redistributed -----------------------------------------
# The Lamrim Chenmo PDF is a copyrighted published edition (Sera Jey Rigzod
# Chenmo). The repo holds everything DERIVED from it, but not the edition itself.
# Put the PDF back at the project root to re-run extraction.
*.pdf

# --- derived, regenerable, and large ----------------------------------------
# Per-glyph audit trail: 116 MB, 978 files. Regenerate with:
#   node tools/11-extract-glyphs.mjs
source/raw/

# Rendered pages, glyph contact sheets, extracted font programs (16 MB).
# Regenerate on demand with tools/09, tools/14, tools/20.
qa/pages/
qa/compare/
qa/glyphs/
qa/font/

# Third-party lexicon, 25 MB (Apache-2.0). Not vendored for size.
# See data/README.md for where to get it. data/syllables.json (derived, 260 KB)
# IS committed, and is what the tools actually read.
data/monlam-lexicon.txt
data/monlam-lexicon-LICENSE.txt

# Batch hand-off files between `tools/32-chunk.mjs batch` and the translation
# workflow. Transient: the durable record is progress.json + glossary.json.
.wf-*.json

# --- standard ----------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
